One note: the tests assert the documented contract (call after `initAsyncData()`), but `SettingsRepositoryImpl.readThemeMode()` itself delegates straight to the datasource and has no runtime guard, so a pre-init call would not throw. I did not change that behavior since you only asked for tests; tell me if you'd like an explicit guard added.
